    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "[`AVCaptureVideoDataOutput`](avcapturevideodataoutput.md) produces preview-sized buffers, which are approximately the size of the screen, when its [`automaticallyConfiguresOutputBufferDimensions`](avcapturevideodataoutput/automaticallyconfiguresoutputbufferdimensions.md) property is [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true).",
      "ko": "The array contains [`CMFormatDescription`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/CoreMedia/CMFormatDescription) objects that indicate the format of media samples the track references.",
      "sourceHash": "c2991990ce3f68061a920f276c633ba328985494e8fdd6c194aaa1ea8b6c10e8",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0002",
      "source": "If you wish to manually set this property, you must first set [`automaticallyConfiguresOutputBufferDimensions`](avcapturevideodataoutput/automaticallyconfiguresoutputbufferdimensions.md) to [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "ko": "이 속성을 수동으로 설정하려면 먼저 [`automaticallyConfiguresOutputBufferDimensions`](avcapturevideodataoutput/automaticallyconfiguresoutputbufferdimensions.md) 속성을 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)로 설정해야 합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "13490b3f80c9a1b37b4416883fdf0949588f52e5db3628493b09353aa6abc57c",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
